  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Thread shrimp onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "3. In a small bowl, mix together zesty seasoning, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "4. Brush the skewers with olive oil and sprinkle with the zesty mixture.",
    "5. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the shrimp are pink and cooked through.",
    "6. Serve hot, garnished with lemon wedges and a sprinkle of zesty seasoning."
  ],
